# Piravom - Town Portal > Piravom is a municipal town in Ernakulam district, Kerala, India, situated
on the banks of the Muvattupuzha River. This portal is a comprehensive directory of local
businesses, services, restaurants, attractions, events, houses of worship, emergency contacts, and
transport information for Piravom and the surrounding area. Important notes: - All distances are
measured from Piravom Town Bus Stand. - Phone numbers listed are local Kerala numbers with STD code
0485 or mobile prefixes. - Restaurant opening hours vary by day (weekday/weekend). Check individual
pages for full schedules. - Attractions marked with a distance are within or near Piravom town
limits. - The site is published at https://piravom.in. ## Restaurants - [All
